#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/algorithms/segment-intersection/cases/carbonLattices.ts:115
msgid "A honeycomb sheet closes circumferentially into a (6,0) zigzag tube; four rows of two sublattices contain 48 atoms and 60 bonds, with two open ends and no caps."
msgstr "蜂窝片层沿周向闭合为 (6,0) 锯齿型管，四排二子格共 48 个原子、60 条键；两端开口，无端帽。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/algorithms/segment-intersection/cases/penrose.ts:80
msgid "A Penrose P3 sun seed undergoes two golden-ratio subdivisions of Robinson triangles, forming a finite patch of 20 complete rhombi. Ideal irrational coordinates are first uniformly approximated to one millionth and then rotated exactly to a fixed view; shared edges are entered only once."
msgstr "彭罗斯 P3 太阳种子经两次 Robinson 三角形黄金分割细分，配成 20 块完整菱形的有限片段。理想无理坐标先统一近似到百万分之一，再精确旋转至固定视角；共享边只输入一次。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/algorithms/segment-intersection/cases/fullerene.ts:49
msgid "A perspective projection of the complete truncated-icosahedral cage retains all 60 atoms and 90 connections. The golden ratio is approximated by 1618/1000; interior crossings in the image are not chemical bond connections."
msgstr "完整截角二十面体球笼的透视投影，保留全部 60 个原子与 90 条连接。黄金比例以 1618/1000 近似；图中内部穿越不代表化学键连接。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
