msgstr "较短斜线段完整包含在另一条线段内。"

#: src/algorithms/convex-hull/cases.ts:65
msgid "A single input is its own hull, displayed as a point."
msgstr "单个输入点本身就是凸包，显示为一个点。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
