#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/algorithms/segment-intersection/cases/fullerene.ts:53
msgid "Each of the 30 icosahedron edges yields two truncation vertices, giving 60 atoms; the 12 original vertices become pentagons and the 20 triangular faces become hexagons. Each atom connects to three neighbors, giving 60 × 3 / 2 = 90 edges and 60 × 3 = 180 endpoint pairs, plus projected crossing pairs. Both front and back layers are retained; the rational approximation of the golden ratio affects only the shape, while the submitted rational coordinates and their intersections are still computed exactly."
msgstr "二十面体的 30 条边各产生两个截角顶点，共 60 个原子；12 个原顶点变成五边形、20 个三角面变成六边形。每个原子连接三个邻居，所以共有 60 × 3 / 2 = 90 条边、60 × 3 = 180 个端点配对，另有投影穿越配对。前后层全部保留；黄金比例的有理近似仅影响几何形状，实际提交的有理坐标及其交点仍被精确计算。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/algorithms/segment-intersection/cases/presets.ts:38
msgid "Each of the 8 inner junctions joins 4 edges, each of the 8 outer junctions joins 3 edges, and the center joins 8 edges. There are 8 + 8 + 1 = 17 distinct intersection positions and 8 × 6 + 8 × 3 + 28 = 100 pairs. For example, four edges at (12, 0) produce 6 pairs, and three edges at (24, 0) produce 3 pairs. There are no crossings between rings and no overlapping edges."
msgstr "内层的 8 个网结各连 4 条边，外层的 8 个网结各连 3 条边，中心连 8 条边。不同交点位置为 8 + 8 + 1 = 17；配对数为 8 × 6 + 8 × 3 + 28 = 100。例如 (12, 0) 的四条边产生 6 对，(24, 0) 的三条边产生 3 对。网环之间不交叉，没有重叠边。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/algorithms/segment-intersection/cases/carbonLattices.ts:110
msgid "Each of the four centers has 4 spatial bonds of equal length, with pairwise direction dot products of −1 and squared lengths of 3, matching the tetrahedral angle. Six shared nearest neighbors have degree 2, and four boundary atoms have degree 1. The projection is (x + 3z/10, y + 7z/10); center (1,1,1) projects to (13/10,17/10), where four bonds produce 6 pairs. S6 and S13 cross internally at (281/100,489/100); a two-dimensional crossing is not an additional chemical bond, and the projection uses exact rational numbers."
msgstr "四个中心各有 4 条等长空间键，其方向两两点积为 −1、长度平方为 3，符合四面体夹角。六个共享近邻度数为 2，四个边界原子度数为 1。投影为 (x + 3z/10, y + 7z/10)；中心 (1,1,1) 投影至 (13/10,17/10)，四条键产生 6 对。S6 与 S13 内部交于 (281/100,489/100)；二维穿越不代表新增化学键，投影使用精确有理数。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/algorithms/segment-intersection/cases/presets.ts:38
msgid "Eight radial spokes connect two octagonal rings; every web junction consists of segment endpoints."
msgstr "八条放射骨架连接两层八边形网环，每个网格连接处都是线段端点。"

